kuicksilver-ktor-client/src/commonMain/kotlin/io/kuicksilver/ktor/client/h1/H1Pool.kt | closeOrderly | withTimeoutOrNull | 1 | pure-wait | an orderly close bounded; the socket is closed in finally either way
kuicksilver-ktor-client/src/commonMain/kotlin/io/kuicksilver/ktor/client/h1/H1Pool.kt | exchangeOnce | withTimeoutOrNull | 1 | pure-wait | awaitContent for 100-continue takes no bytes; the answer stays in the input for readResponse
kuicksilver-ktor-client/src/commonMain/kotlin/io/kuicksilver/ktor/client/h1/H1Pool.kt | obtain | withTimeout | 1 | made-flag | conn, stream and reused are set inside the block; a timeout that lands as it returns releases them in the catch (never lost), the call fails as a connect timeout
kuicksilver-ktor-client/src/commonMain/kotlin/io/kuicksilver/ktor/client/h1/H1Pool.kt | remoteHosts | withTimeout | 1 | side-effect-free | the request's DNS answers: they stay in dns for the race, the connect timeout fails the call
kuicksilver-ktor-client/src/commonMain/kotlin/io/kuicksilver/ktor/client/h1/H1Pool.kt | webSocketConnection | withTimeoutOrNull | 1 | pure-wait | watches a StateFlow for an HTTP/2 SETTINGS change; nothing is consumed
kuicksilver-ktor-client/src/commonMain/kotlin/io/kuicksilver/ktor/client/h2/H2Pool.kt | closeAll | withTimeoutOrNull | 1 | pure-wait | awaits the connections' close; they are closed hard after it either way
kuicksilver-ktor-client/src/commonMain/kotlin/io/kuicksilver/ktor/client/h2/H2WebSocket.kt | h2WebSocket | withTimeoutOrNull | 1 | pure-wait | the close wait after this side's END_STREAM (the wait for the server's end uses completedWithin); its result is not used
kuicksilver-ktor-client/src/commonMain/kotlin/io/kuicksilver/ktor/client/h3/H3Pool.kt | connectWebTransport | withTimeout | 1 | made-flag | made is set inside the timeout; a handshake that completes as it fires is used (made != null), never orphaned
kuicksilver-ktor-client/src/commonMain/kotlin/io/kuicksilver/ktor/client/h3/H3Pool.kt | connectionEntryOnce | withTimeout | 1 | made-flag | made is set inside the timeout; a handshake that completes as it fires is closed in the catch, never orphaned
kuicksilver-ktor-client/src/commonMain/kotlin/io/kuicksilver/ktor/client/h3/H3Pool.kt | goAwayAll | withTimeoutOrNull | 2 | pure-wait | a GOAWAY written within its bound; the result is not used
