kuicksilver-ktor-client/src/commonMain/kotlin/io/kuicksilver/ktor/client/h3/H3Pool.kt | webSocket | withTimeoutOrNull | 3 | pure-wait | the close steps after the server's end was read (completedWithin keeps that): the FIN, the drain after T2; each bounds an end already chosen
